      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "T1: mov rax, [sum] ; rax(T1) = 0\n[...]\nT2: mov rax, [sum] ; rax(T2) = 0\nT2: mov rbx, [v]    ; rbx(T2) = 1\nT2: add rax, rbx    ; rax(T2) = 1\nT2: mov [sum], rax ; sum = 1\n[...]\n\nT1: mov rbx, [v]     ; rbx(T2) = 1\nT1: add rax, rbx     ; rax(T2) = 1\nT1: mov [sum], rax  ; sum = 1",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "T1: mov rax, [sum] ; rax(T1) = 0\n[...]\nT2: mov rax, [sum] ; rax(T2) = 0\nT2: mov rbx, [v]    ; rbx(T2) = 1\nT2: add rax, rbx    ; rax(T2) = 1\nT2: mov [sum], rax ; sum = 1\n[...]\n\nT1: mov rbx, [v]     ; rbx(T2) = 1\nT1: add rax, rbx     ; rax(T2) = 1\nT1: mov [sum], rax  ; sum = 1",
